+# truncateMiddle notes
+
+## Plan
+1. [x] Add `truncateMiddle(text, max)` to `src/cli/truncate.ts`: result length <= max, keeps head and tail around `…`.
+2. [x] Add `test/cli/truncate.test.ts` (node:test).
+3. [x] Run `npm run fast`, commit.
+
+## Decisions
+- Ellipsis is the single char `…`; length counted in code points.
+- Text with length <= max is returned unchanged.
+- max < 1 returns ''; max === 1 returns `…`.
+- Head gets the extra char when the kept count is odd.
+- Test files need a weight in scripts/lib/shard-weights.mjs (added 0.1).
